      "provenance": "GATING. Peak-envelope growth exp(sigma*T) across the analysis window. The 1.3x figure is taken deliberately unchanged from fbwa.detrended_growth() so the acceptance STRENGTH matches the validated stages while the ESTIMATOR is the well-posed one - see the ESTIMATOR NOTE above.",
