    "status": "DORMANT_NOT_EXECUTED",
    "authorisation": "AUTOTUNE is NOT authorised by this stage and is NOT run by this file. It may only be run after an INDEPENDENT evidence review concludes, from the navigation campaign data, that the current PIDs are genuinely inadequate during navigation. The decision inputs are recorded per scenario in analysis.autotune_decision_support (roll/pitch tracking error statistics, saturation duty cycle, oscillation growth). Those numbers are DECISION SUPPORT ONLY and never gate this stage.",
    "level": {
      "AUTOTUNE_LEVEL": 8,
